583 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our solution presents an innovative idea to enhance engagement, well-being and professional development in SACE. The goal is to develop a product that leverages Artificial Intelligence to improve engagement across the organization. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
584 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In a rapidly evolving technological world, AI is revolutionizing various sectors, including human resources management. Integrating AI into HR processes opens new frontiers for process optimization, routine tasks automation, and the customization of employee experiences. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
585 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our project was developed through a comprehensive methodology. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
