652 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To assess employee engagement with Workday, SACE tracks four key performance indicators \(KPIs\): Monthly Active Users, Career Hub Journey Completion, Skill and Initiative Input, and Feedback Requests and Responses. The aim is to achieve 80% employee participation across these metrics by the end of the year. Despite improvements in the redesigned Career GPS 2.0, active engagement remains low \(30%\), largely due to infrequent skill validation. To address this, Workday will introduce monthly skill updates and trend analysis. Currently, over 60% of employees have registered their skills and interests, and increased monthly use of Career GPS is anticipated.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
