/E (The PESTEL analysis is a strategic tool used to examine the macro-environmental factors influencing an organization. In the context of SACE, which operates in the insurance and financial sector, we analysed the impact of Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) in Human Resources \(HR\) functions through the following dimensions:)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [0]
>>
