/T (Especially for volunteering, SACE is already supporting social issues with Flex4giving Back  and the aim of this initiative is to strengthen the social responsibility commitments, where community contribution and employee well-being are the main focus. \(SACE, 2024\) With this initiative from 2024, 17 associations and 394 colleagues were involved, with 1983 hours of volunteering activities organised.  \(SACE, 2025\) These initiatives include panting a senior centre, tending a flowerbed, helping at a family home, volunteering at Caritas soup kitchen.)
