/S /P
/E (For your first question, Career GPS was used last year, but the current version \(2.0\) has a new layout to give employees a clearer understanding of their skill gaps and matches. We expect usage to increase, but so far about 30% of employees have used it actively, while 70% only accessed it once, mainly because skill validation was only carried out twice a year. With monthly updates planned, we expect greater engagement.)
/Pg 57 0 R
/K [9]
